--- !u!114 &8001923797750437545
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6645486176492085933}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1a688ceb77ec1554a9c1805812809e50, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcName: Alan
  lines:
  - speakerName: 'Player:'
    line: "The man looked like your typical whaler\u2014sun-bleached clothes, salt-stained
      boots, and a smell that could gut a seagull at ten paces. His face held scars
      that surely had tales to tell. One of them, a jagged cut of skin, split his
      cheek like a lightning bolt frozen in flesh, and the rest of his face looked
      carved from wind and grit."
    choices: []
  - speakerName: 'Player:'
    line: "The man looked like your typical whaler\u2014sun-bleached clothes, salt-stained
      boots, and a smell that could gut a seagull at ten paces. His face held scars
      that surely had tales to tell. One of them, a jagged cut of skin, split his
      cheek like a lightning bolt frozen in flesh, and the rest of his face looked
      carved from wind and grit."
    choices: []
  - speakerName: 'Player:'
    line: "\u201CI\u2019m looking for my friend Nathan, wouldn\u2019t happen to know
      where he dives, would you?\u201D"
    choices: []
  - speakerName: '???:'
    line: "\u201CAh, Nathan? Yeah, I know him. Bit squirrelly\u2014always jabberin\u2019
      about old ruins like he was about to discover Atlantis with a pocket compass
      and a half-eaten sandwich. I seen him go out a few times. Real determined.
      Real twitchy. Why d\u2019you ask? He finally dig a hole too deep?\u201D "
    choices: []
  - speakerName: 'Player:'
    line: "\u201CHe went out diving and hasn\u2019t come back. I\u2019m trying to
      track him down.\u201D "
    choices: []
  - speakerName: '???:'
    line: "\u201CFigures. Either he found what he was lookin\u2019 for\u2026 or it
      found him. My bet? Sea serpent. Or a cursed statue. Or one of those angry barnacles
      that whisper your worst fears. Y\u2019know, island stuff. You need a ride out
      to his dive spots? I could take you. For a price, of course\u2014I run a fine
      service, Alan\u2019s Flight of Fancy \u2014 adventure included, premium snacks
      not.\u201D "
    choices: []
  - speakerName: 'Player:'
    line: "\u201CI\u2019m a bit short on funds right now.\u201D"
    choices: []
  - speakerName: 'Alan:'
    line: "\u201CTell you what\u2014grab some of them fat crabs off the north beach,
      give \u2018em to Jim on my behalf. He\u2019ll trade his soul for shellfish.
      Just don\u2019t name them. Makes eating 'em weird. Three oughta be enough for
      me to take you to the closest place I\u2019ve seen him go. Do that, and we
      got a deal.\u201D"
    choices: []
  - speakerName: 'Player:'
    line: '"Got it, three crabs to Jim on your behalf and you''ll take me out. Sounds
      Good, I''ll be back later."'
    choices: []
